an early member of the Black Dog Mercenaries and serves as their chief strategist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He excels at strategy and is ruthless, using any means necessary to achieve his goals. He is also skilled in magic, and his skills surpass those of most magicians."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This time, he receives an order from the leader, Vult, to “create a brothel that symbolizes a nation of service,” and he ends up turning many beautiful women into prostitutes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c121160"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4dd97fb65d8579277bacf72912c6aced946f3214f1c7e116258eea31643e95a4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/0858cf44a5cfd8e81de3fc58608edead54ef606d562d9518a9845043eac90025.webp","width":256,"height":234,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c121161","characterName":"ヴォルト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c121161"},"originalCharacterName":"ヴォルト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The \"King of Mercenaries\" and leader of the Sex Empire. An outlaw who works to fulfill his desires. Looks like a man in his late 30s. He possesses strong leadership skills and is also a gifted strategist. His personal combat skills are excellent, and he’s a man filled with carnal lusts at heart. He lives for the flames and struggles of war and actively spearheads the pillaging and rape of others."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c121161"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/8490d2f632d86f7156eb244bf3ee0ed18cf646234d5bfa6caf12337dc5ae9c3f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c871823f572afc4d13129a0f668b1fbdec395a480132e26b897f510d33bf6b1e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124039","characterName":"ラドミラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124039"},"originalCharacterName":"ラドミラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who was used as a scullery maid and sex worker in a slaver's shop. She was thought to be a mere beast, but her true identity is that of a Tiefling."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tieflings are said to be able to captivate their opponents with their unusual power of fascination. However, she is unaware of this, and her abilities have not yet blossomed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of the harsh treatment she received in the slavers' trade, she is a withdrawn person with no prospects for the future."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124039"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d0c4eeca0cf38ad88e499b077ad80f46618ffb163bec5823ec113f121047337.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8f38350679349942436be478e24f046b3ff096dc2d367e840c03874ef30e249b.webp","width":120,"height":160,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ハヲリ","creatorId":"vndb:s999","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s999","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s999","name":"間宮 菜南子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92847","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124040","characterName":"ソフィア・ファン・グレア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124040"},"originalCharacterName":"ソフィア・ファン・グレア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a former queen of the climatically mild and prosperous kingdom of Sangrea. Her husband, the king, is murdered in a rebellion by an ambitious minister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After fleeing with her only daughter, a baby in her arms, she ends up in the favelas of the service state. Despite her poor life, she is neither despicable nor resentful. She values chastity like a queen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her husband, the king, was a light-hearted man, and she is sexually inexperienced."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124040"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0aecf509c71aa72d252f43f94d6528bad237597637e0d07d2bbe3bc6da4e0520.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/686b2d3bc8ac0298b8299e7473028d2f2c5a3938993cd559291690c962e377a0.webp","width":120,"height":160,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葉村 夏緒","creatorId":"vndb:s24","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24","name":"西口 有香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92843","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124041","characterName":"レオナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124041"},"originalCharacterName":"レオナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the leader of the White Wolf Mercenaries, a group of wolf-like beastmen known as the Hungry Wolf Tribe. She is nicknamed “Hundred Slayers” for the way she conquers battlefields one after another, and her military prowess is such that she can hold her own with the Black Titan mercenaries."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is not only strong, but also respectful of humanity and compassionate. She is especially protective of her fellow mercenaries. Perhaps because of this sense of camaraderie, she is not treated as a “woman” in the group and has no desire to be treated as such."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has little interest in or desire for sex, and has only had the rare experience of comforting herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124041"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13dd2d4bf3f927cedb75c41ed8285992b1e07b8fdc79d5779280d555a2d8cd2e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e67739ac52c5eecf2630bdc3989c2032d4bb138eab32e726972f1fde423205c2.webp","width":120,"height":160,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葵 時緒","creatorId":"vndb:s1658","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1658","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1658","name":"葵時緒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92846","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124042","characterName":"エミリア・ソルヴァ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124042"},"originalCharacterName":"エミリア・ソルヴァ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the leader of the Knights of St. Bernard, an order of pure maidens who are followers of the goddess Larenthia."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although there are only female members, their abilities are genuine, and Emilia, the leader of the order, is so skilled in military prowess that she is rumored to be a “brave warrior with a spear.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For Emilia, who values justice and integrity, the service state is nothing more than a crucible for vice. In order to save the oppressed women, she rides into the country of service."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124042"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba6a53e5959a637369a994dc6f0fc847679d9fe5b128d7a21adbe4a8cf8a1fd6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02c5ed7f81287a98de0df26ea28b571a0cb9b2501cb4f9838e465369e5c6c773.webp","width":120,"height":160,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"美空 なつひ","creatorId":"vndb:s939","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s939","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s939","name":"平井 まみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92845","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c124043","characterName":"エヴリン・モワナール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c124043"},"originalCharacterName":"エヴリン・モワナール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the queen of Fulstadja, a small High Elven kingdom that occupies a forested area."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is called the “Jewel of Fulstadja” for her beauty, she is still young for a High Elf at 150 years of age, and her appearance is still very childlike."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On the other hand, she excels in magic and has no equal in the country. However, perhaps because of her beauty, magical power, and position, she is selfish and arrogant, and throws tantrums when she does not get her way."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even so, she takes pride in being the queen loved by the people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c124043"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c845adc592d9ebff578434bc1a05a4dd9ee85db41ae8706f3e9409e7448b5fe2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d4b434c8dde18c17b7e3a97a1182ac775cb1fc2474c21edde7b5447e9e9c545.webp","width":120,"height":160,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"氷室 百合","creatorId":"vndb:s694","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s694","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s694","name":"ひむろゆり(氷室百合)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92844","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p430","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:831","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p430","name":"Liquid","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:33320:831","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p430","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p430","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p430","name":"リキッド","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:106659:v38514","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p430","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p430","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p430","name":"リキッド","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:106660:v38514","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p430","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p430","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p430","name":"リキッド","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:106792:v38514","source":"vndb"},{"companyId